── (A) One-off: apptainer exec ──
$ apptainer exec /home/ywatanabe/.scitex/agent-container/containers/sac-scitex.sif python -c "print(\"hi from sif\")"
  # → hi from sif
(dry-run; pass --apply, requires SIF built)

── (B) Long-living: sac agents start + send + tail ──
$ sac agents start hello-agent
  # → started in background; PID + heartbeat written to runtime/<name>/
$ sac agents send  hello-agent "What is 2 + 2?"
  # → 4
$ sac agents tail  hello-agent --json -n 5
  # → last 5 JSONL records: user turn, assistant turn, tool_use, result
$ sac agents stop  hello-agent
  # → SIGTERM, escalates to SIGKILL after 5s
